        <p>The rate is only half the paycheck. The schedule is the other half. Below, $64 an hour runs through every common schedule, gross and federal-only take-home for a single filer under the 2026 rules, worked out the same way as the after-tax section, with one column to read first: what each hour actually keeps after tax.</p>
